text.section:
The Commission shall also charge additional fees:

Of $330 per day per examiner during examinations for the supervision and regulation of trust departments;


Of $10,000 for investigating an application for a certificate of authority pursuant to § 6.2-816;


Of $1,800 for investigating an application for authority to establish a branch pursuant to § 6.2-831 or a facility pursuant to § 6.2-835;


Of $7,500 for investigating an application of merger. The Commission shall not be entitled to any further fees for investigating any application to retain existing branches of the applying banks as branches of the merged bank;


Of $1,000 for investigating an application for authority to change the location of an existing bank or branch bank; and


Of $2,000 for investigating an application for authority to exercise trust powers.
